cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MATS, cite this software release and the companion manuscript when available."
title: "Morphometric Analysis Toolbox for Segmentation (MATS)"
abstract: >-
  Software for measuring leaf area, length, and width in physical units from
  photographs taken on a printed calibration template. MATS detects fiducial
  markers with RF-DETR, corrects perspective, and segments leaves with Otsu
  thresholding by default or optional BiRefNet.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
authors:
  - family-names: Ackerman
    given-names: A.J.
  - family-names: Wiesner-Hanks
    given-names: Tyr
  - family-names: Reidel
    given-names: Edwin
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Breeding-Insight/Morphometric-Analysis-Toolbox-for-Segmentation"
keywords:
  - plant phenomics
  - morphometrics
  - leaf area
  - image segmentation
  - RF-DETR
  - BiRefNet
